<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: AIB announces interim dividend of 6.8p/shr.</title>
<headline>AIB announces interim dividend of 6.8p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Irish Banks Plc said on Tuesday that it was declaring an interim dividend for 1997 of 6.8 pence per share, an increase of 14.3 percent on 1996.  </p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on or after September 24 to shareholders on the company's register at the close of business on July 4, AIB said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shareholders will also be offered the opportunity to opt for new shares instead of cash in respect of the dividend.</p>
</text>
